                        <input type="number" id="rrEditMaxSelections" class="form-control" min="0" max="25" placeholder="No limit">
                        <span class="form-text">How many options a member can choose from the menu in one go. Each pick still adds or removes roles one by one, so this does not cap how many of the panel's roles they hold. Blank or 0 means no limit.</span>
